{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1418493-how-storyguide\u2019s-characters-lie-to-players","id":1418493,"title":"How Storyguide\u2019s characters lie to players?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-10-16T01:14:15-07:00","id":1418493,"title":"How Storyguide\u2019s characters lie to players?","content":"Hello,<br /> <br /> For my questions I assume no boons and knacks are involved.<br /> Do you roll when storyguide\u2019s characters lie to players? If yes how determine the difficulty?<br /> <br /> And how players can detect a storyguide\u2019s character lie to him?<br /> <br /> Thanks in advance!<br /> <br /> PS: English is not my native language so be soft on my errors..<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26485-mk3ultimate","name":"mk3ultimate","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T03:39:50-07:00","id":1418498,"title":"","content":"For deception I get my players to roll Cunning or Composure+Subterfuge as an ersatz insight check, maybe throw that against the liar's Presence or Manipulation+Subterfuge if it's more significant.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26056-cassiecataria","name":"CassieCataria","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26056_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T07:21:24-07:00","id":1418524,"title":"","content":"<b>Lier / Deceptor</b>: Generally - <u>Subterfuge </u>(even Empathy in some circumstances) + Manipulation/Composure(hiding emotions)/Dex(shifting bodylanguage)/Cunning<br /> <br /> <b>Character beeing lied to / Deceptee</b>: <u>Subterfuge</u>/<u>Empathy</u>/<u>Integrity </u>+ Composure(Resisting escpecially emotional lies)/Resolve(active watching for lies)/Cunning() This all depends on the vector the lier uses.<br /> <br /> Normally i would only allow rolls - if a) the lies are deductable b) there is reason not to trust the character c) the lie of the lier is flawed or they are anxious. d) the pkayer desperatly wants to roll for it.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Gamelines: Requiem, Lost, Awakening, Trinity Continuum: Aeon, some V5.<br /> Likes cheesecake (quark-based)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1305-maekkel","name":"maekkel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"206"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T07:52:13-07:00","id":1418527,"title":"","content":"Since most antagonists don't have the standard skills as the players, usually what I do for things like &quot;How do the players spot a lie?&quot;<br /> <br /> I try to avoid opposed rolls for NPCs as often I can. Example:<br /> <br /> No - NPC rolling Secondary Pool to lie vs PC rolling their Empathy + Mental<br /> <br /> Yes - NPC is lying. PC rolls Empathy + Mental at Difficulty 3 to realize this.<br /> <br /> Note: This also applies to most other non-combat things. &quot;What roll-off should be used for stealth?&quot; &quot;Eh, sounds like a pain. Have the players roll Subterfuge versus a static difficulty to sneak past someone, have them roll an appropriate skill to notice someone sneaking past them&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":2142,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","user":"Kyman201","date":". 10-16-2020, 02:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}